{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Using the average synodic cycle anchored to the new moon record, not a complete astronomical ephemeris. The time of an individual’s phase may vary by hours and the date displayed in UTC may differ from the date on the local calendar. This international phase estimate does not calculate local moonrise, moonset, appearance, or religious calendar dates.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"moon-phase-calculator UI copy.fields.methodNote","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote","keys":["moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Matumizi ya wastani synodic mzunguko anchored kwa kumbukumbu mwezi mpya, si ephemeris kamili astronomia. Mara ya awamu ya mtu binafsi inaweza kutofautiana kwa masaa na tarehe iliyoonyeshwa UTC inaweza kutofautiana kutoka tarehe ya kalenda ya mitaa. hii ya kimataifa awamu makadirio haina mahesabu ya mitaa moonrise, moonset, kuonekana, au tarehe kalenda ya kidini.","record_id":"375e71a93b6272f36cd44b11bbe878d720219b259341cc55e5c6f5e92392ab09","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.392030518625006,"source":"Uses a mean synodic cycle anchored to a reference new moon, not a full astronomical ephemeris. Individual phase times can differ by hours and the displayed UTC date can differ from a local calendar date. This global phase estimate does not calculate local moonrise, moonset, visibility, or religious calendar dates.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"30870c684a9b7cbcd78603b289a08388959d9db0a9b4d591addd5741a14786a4","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Matumizi ya wastani synodic mzunguko anchored kwa kumbukumbu mwezi mpya, si ephemeris kamili astronomia. Mara ya awamu ya mtu binafsi inaweza kutofautiana kwa masaa na tarehe iliyoonyeshwa UTC inaweza kutofautiana kutoka tarehe ya kalenda ya mitaa. hii ya kimataifa awamu makadirio haina mahesabu ya mitaa moonrise, moonset, kuonekana, au tarehe kalenda ya kidini.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
